<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Google Business Profile Optimization | Rank #1 Locally</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            /* ব্যাকগ্রাউন্ড ওয়ালপেপার এবং ডার্ক ওভারলে */
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.92)), 
                        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366216548-37526070297c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80') no-repeat center center/cover;
            background-attachment: fixed;
            color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* নেভিগেশন বার */
        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 8%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: #4285F4; /* Google Blue */
        }

        .nav-btn {
            background: #4285F4;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px 22px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-btn:hover {
            background: #3367D6;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* হিরো সেকশন */
        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 100px 8% 70px;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(66, 133, 244, 0.2);
            color: #60a5fa;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(66, 133, 244, 0.4);
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 46px;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4285F4, #34A853, #FBBC05, #EA4335);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .cta-group {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: #34A853; /* Google Green */
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 32px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #2b8a44;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(52, 168, 83, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 32px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        }

        /* সার্ভিস কার্ড সেকশন */
        .services {
            padding: 60px 8%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            border-color: #4285F4;
        }

        .card-icon {
            font-size: 34px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #f8fafc;
        }

        .card p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }

        /* অডিট / কন্টাক্ট ফর্ম */
        .contact-section {
            padding: 60px 8% 100px;
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        .form-box {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        .form-box h2 {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .form-box p {
            text-align: center;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .input-group {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .input-group input, .input-group textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 15px;
            outline: none;
        }

        .input-group input:focus, .input-group textarea:focus {
            border-color: #4285F4;
        }

        .submit-btn {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px;
            background: #4285F4;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .submit-btn:hover {
            background: #3367D6;
        }

        #success-msg {
            display: none;
            text-align: center;
            color: #34A853;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 32px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">GMB<span>Pro</span></div>
        <a href="#audit" class="nav-btn">Free Profile Audit</a>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="badge">🚀 Local SEO & Google Maps Ranking Expert</div>
        <h1>Rank #1 on Google Maps with <span>Google Profile Optimization</span></h1>
        <p>Turn local searches into paying customers. We optimize your Google Business Profile to increase calls, website visits, and foot traffic organically.</p>
        <div class="cta-group">
            <a href="#audit" class="btn-primary">Get Free GMB Audit</a>
            <a href="#services" class="btn-secondary">Explore Services</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services" id="services">
        <h2 class="section-title">What We Optimize For Your Business</h2>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">📍</div>
                <h3>Complete Profile Setup</h3>
                <p>Accurate NAP (Name, Address, Phone), primary & secondary categories, and keyword-rich business descriptions.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">⭐</div>
                <h3>Review & Reputation Growth</h3>
                <p>Proven strategies to get 5-star customer reviews and professional SEO-friendly responses to every review.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">📸</div>
                <h3>Geo-Tagged Photos & Posts</h3>
                <p>Weekly Google Business updates, offers, and geo-tagged high-resolution photos to boost local relevance.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">📈</div>
                <h3>Local Citations & Map Pack</h3>
                <p>High-authority directory listings and local backlinks to push your business into the Google Top 3 Map Pack.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact-section" id="audit">
        <div class="form-box">
            <h2>Request a Free GMB Audit</h2>
            <p>Enter your business details below and get a complete ranking report within 24 hours.</p>
            <form id="auditForm">
                <div class="input-group">
                    <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required>
                </div>
                <div class="input-group">
                    <input type="text" placeholder="Business Name & City" required>
                </div>
                <div class="input-group">
                    <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email Address" required>
                </div>
                <div class="input-group">
                    <textarea rows="3" placeholder="Tell us about your business goals..."></textarea>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Get My Free Audit Now</button>
                <div id="success-msg">✅ Thank you! Your audit request has been received.</div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        &copy; 2026 GMBPro Local SEO Services. All Rights Reserved.
    </footer>

    <script>
        document.getElementById('auditForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
            e.preventDefault();
            document.getElementById('success-msg').style.display = 'block';
            this.reset();
        });
    </script>

</body>
</html>
